        "name": "function 1",
        "func": "let danhSachTen = [\"Cốp\", \"David\", \"Vinh\"];\nlet dssv = [];\n\nfor (let i = 0; i < danhSachTen.length; i++) {\n    dssv.push({\n        \"name\": danhSachTen[i],\n        \"money\": Math.floor(Math.random() * 1000) + 100 \n    });\n}\n\nmsg.payload = {\n    \"ok\": 1,\n    \"msg\": \"thành công\",\n    \"dssv\": dssv\n};\n\nreturn msg;",
